window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>It's the most magical time of year, sisters.</i></b></p> <p>The holidays have come to Eckhart, NC, and the Silver sisters are ready to celebrate in true witchy style. Alys, Maeve, and a very pregnant Siobhan Silver are hosting a magical gift exchange as well as a Yule bonfire and sing-along at the cottage on Witch Way. But when a werewolf who has been missing for more than a year shows up and begs them for help finding his missing mate, how can the softhearted sisters refuse?</p> <p>If you love later-in-life romance, magic at midlife adventure, and an extra helping of holiday hoopla, you don't want to miss Jennifer L. Hart's charming tale.</p> <p>Buy<i> Jingle All the Witch Way </i>and embrace the spirits of the season today!</p>"; 
